        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "Hi ,\nWent to this clinic to meet with Dr Potter as my doctor retired after 38 yeay being with him he was private too\nWas very well treated\nDr potter is very nice  and very professional and very knowledgeable\nIn modern medicine.\nVery happy to be with him.\nAnd the front desk very well received.\nThank you",
